          "ImageDescription": {
            "source": "commons-desc-page",
            "value": "Soprano <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Montserrat_Alavedra_i_Comas?action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Montserrat Alavedra i Comas (page does not exist)\" class=\"new\" typeof=\"mw:LocalizedAttrs\" data-mw-i18n='{\"title\":{\"lang\":\"x-page\",\"key\":\"red-link-title\",\"params\":[\"Montserrat Alavedra i Comas\"]}}'>Montserrat Alavedra i Comas</a> is joined by <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/William_McColl?action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"William McColl (page does not exist)\" class=\"new\" typeof=\"mw:LocalizedAttrs\" data-mw-i18n='{\"title\":{\"lang\":\"x-page\",\"key\":\"red-link-title\",\"params\":[\"William McColl\"]}}'>William McColl</a>, clarinet, and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Joseph_Levine?action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Joseph Levine (page does not exist)\" class=\"new\" typeof=\"mw:LocalizedAttrs\" data-mw-i18n='{\"title\":{\"lang\":\"x-page\",\"key\":\"red-link-title\",\"params\":[\"Joseph Levine\"]}}'>Joseph Levine</a>, fortepiano. The clarinet is a Bb clarinet made by Mollenhauer in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Fulda,_Germany?action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Fulda, Germany (page does not exist)\" class=\"new\" typeof=\"mw:LocalizedAttrs\" data-mw-i18n='{\"title\":{\"lang\":\"x-page\",\"key\":\"red-link-title\",\"params\":[\"Fulda, Germany\"]}}'>Fulda, Germany</a> about 1820 - 1825. The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Fortepiano?action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" title=\"Fortepiano (page does not exist)\" class=\"new\" typeof=\"mw:LocalizedAttrs\" data-mw-i18n='{\"title\":{\"lang\":\"x-page\",\"key\":\"red-link-title\",\"params\":[\"Fortepiano\"]}}'>fortepiano</a> was a copy of a Mozart-era instrument."
